MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_Esm_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_Esm_m01_001: I don't want to die...
MID_LGA_1DIT_c02_Esm_m01: <BLN>*sob*
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_Crn_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_Crn_m01_001: All this talk of doom coming to the village! And they\nwant to sacrifice Esmeralda to stop it...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_Crn_m01_002: What should I do? What can I do?
MID_LGA_1DIT_c02_Crn_m01: <BLN>What can I do?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_Lan_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_Lan_m01_001: If only that fool woman had stayed quiet and done\nwhat I told her!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_Lan_m01_002: What's your problem? Back off.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c02_Lan_m01: <BLN>Fool woman!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_B01_m01_001: We defied the spirits. The sea beast attacks are proof\nenough of that!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_B01_m01_002: Our shaman said so. What choice do we have?
MID_LGA_1DIT_c02_B01_m01: <BLN>We're being judged!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_B02_m01_001: Ever since the sea beasts came to the reef, our boats\nhave been getting clobbered!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_B02_m01_002: Now we can't even go out to sea and fish. Things\nare going to get real bad real soon...
MID_LGA_1DIT_c02_B02_m01: <BLN>Sea beasts... What do we do?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_B03_m01_001: Poor Esmeralda. I feel sorry for her, but for the good\nof the village, we HAVE to sacrifice her!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c02_B03_m01: <BLN>I do feel sorry for the girl...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_B04_m01_001: I don't want Esme to die!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c02_B04_m01: <BLN>Esme... Don't go!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_B05_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_B05_m01_001: You'd better watch what you say to Randa if you\ndon't want to get on the village's bad side.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_B05_m01_002: That's what I do! I don't need trouble.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c02_B05_m01: <BLN>Just let Randa have what he wants.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_B06_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_B06_m01_001: You know, maybe Randa has gone too far this time.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c02_B06_m01_002: Maybe THIS is what will bring down the wrath of\nthe spirits!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c02_B06_m01: <BLN>Is Randa going too far this time?